\n</html>\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n</edit>\n<status>\n✓ Файл app/index.htmlUT изменён: добавлены стили Dark Glassmorphism, Neon UI и Skeuomorphism. Использованы CSS-переменные для цветов, теней и радиуса.\n✓ План: создать style.css с переменными и компонентами.\n</status>\n<write path=\"style.css\">\n```css\n:root {\n  --bg-color: #0d0d12;\n  --card-glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  --radius: 16px;\n  --shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.3) inset 0 4px 8px;\n  --neon-accent: #0ff;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--bg-color);\n  border: 1px solid var(--card-glass);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.card::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -4px; left: -4px;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), transparent);\n}\n.card::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -4px; left: -4px;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), transparent);\n}\nbutton {\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0ff, #00ff);\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 10px 20px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 0 6px #0ff;\n  transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);\n}\nbutton:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 0 6px #0ff;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\ninput {\n  background: var(--bg-color);\n  color: white;\n  border: 1px solid var(--card-glass);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 10px;\n  box-shadow: inset 0 4px 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\nheader h1 {\n  color: white;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}\n```\n</write>\n<status>\n✓ Создан style.css с CSS-переменными и компонентами в стиле Dark Glassmorphism + Neon UI + Skeuomorphism.\n✓ Файлы app/index.htmlUT и style.css обновлены. Проект готов к сб